1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:00,970
You just lost

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:02,360
a fight with gravity.

3
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:03,670
Stand up fast,

4
00:00:03,690 --> 00:00:05,270
and about half a liter of blood

5
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:06,640
drops into your legs.

6
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:07,960
Pressure dips.

7
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,620
Less blood reaches your head.

8
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,310
Your oxygen-hungry retina

9
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:12,420
glitches first...

10
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,450
sparks...

11
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,010
then a grey tunnel.

12
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,430
Fighter pilots get that tunnel

13
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:17,560
in hard turns.

14
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:18,790
It's called a grey-out.

15
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,610
Then pressure sensors in your neck

16
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:21,570
catch the drop.

17
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:22,740
Your heart speeds up,

18
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:23,900
vessels squeeze,

19
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,190
and your vision comes back.

20
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,970
How often does this happen to you?

21
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,050
Happens a lot, or you faint?

22
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,110
Tell a doctor.
